CandidateSummary(case_id='asyncssl', root_cause='Test synchronization race in ObserverAttachedBeforeConnect. TLS 1.3 NewSessionTickets are still unread when the first timestamped write is made; AsyncSocket handleRead consumes the tickets and then the echo in one loop without re-draining the error queue, where the ACK timestamp is already queued (ioReady drains it only on entry), so writeAndReflect returns before the ACK ByteEvent is delivered. Fix drains post-handshake data with an untimestamped writeAndReflect first.', patch_path='/home/newton/work/dev-hermit/worktrees/slots/tfa-phase2-cyber-opus/ignored/tfa-phase2-three-case/investigation/asyncssl/agent-output/patch.diff')
